<html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
<title>a font element is inline and maps color, size and face to CSS</title>
<meta name="assert" content="HTML 15.3.4: font is phrasing content; color maps to color, size=5 to font-size x-large, face to font-family."/>
</head>
<body><p>before <font color="green" size="5" face="monospace">font</font> after</p>
</body>
</html>
